[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3433553564","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909#issuecomment-3433553564","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111909","id":3433553564,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Mp96c","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-22T17:59:07Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T18:00:10Z","body":"Note that this PR *will* impact https://github.com/GodotModding/godot-mod-loader due to the removal of `--script`, unless the project uses a custom export template compiled with `disable_path_overrides=no`. It will have to find another means of injecting its code into projects.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/6137 could make this possible using `override.cfg`, as long as the project uses official export templates (or doesn't change `disable_overrides` from its default `no` state in custom templates).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3433553564/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3433558417","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909#issuecomment-3433558417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111909","id":3433558417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Mp_GR","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-22T18:00:29Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T18:00:29Z","body":"> https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/6137 could make this possible using override.cfg.\r\n\r\nThere's already a way to use it without any changes (see comment in the proposal), which looks a bit hacky but should work.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3433558417/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3433575308","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909#issuecomment-3433575308","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111909","id":3433575308,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MqDOM","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-22T18:04:36Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T18:04:36Z","body":"> Also, note that if you cd to a project folder (not a PCK), you can still run it directly with an export template binary\r\n\r\nSeems like `get_bundle_resource_dir` on Linux is `.`, so this is likely the reason, I will add some extra checks.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3433575308/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3479229127","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909#issuecomment-3479229127","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111909","id":3479229127,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PYNLH","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T07:27:08Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T09:30:30Z","body":"Some notes:\r\n\r\nOptions disabled by `disable_path_overrides` (enabled by default for templates, always false for editor):\r\n\r\n- `--path` and `--scene` - used to run editor instances (including project running form editor), so should not be needed for the export templates.\r\n- `--upwards` - used for unit test in the editor, so not needed for templates.\r\n- `-s`, `--main-loop` - intended primarily for the engine development (but also used by mod loader, so will break its current installation method).\r\n- `--main-pack` - seems to be used only on Web, so enabled for this platform only.\r\n\r\nOptions disabled in release templates:\r\n- `--remote-fs` and `--remote-fs-password` - can be used by editor to run project on remote device (editor always use debug template).\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3479229127/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3479589749","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909#issuecomment-3479589749","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111909","id":3479589749,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PZlN1","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T09:19:39Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T09:20:04Z","body":"> `--upwards` - not sure why this option exist, seems completely useless, maybe we should remove in entirely?\r\n\r\nYeah that's a legacy option, it lets you run a Godot project while in a subfolder by looking up the `project.godot` file recursively. It's dates back to Godot being open sourced.\r\n\r\nLet's keep it for now but deprecated (printing a warning about it), so if users rely on it in some scripts, they'll have until 4.7 to adapt their scripts, and we can drop it then.\r\n\r\n*Edit:* Actually scratch that, let's just drop it straight and document it in the migration guide. It's simple enough to work around when upgrading.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3479589749/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3479625049","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909#issuecomment-3479625049","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111909","id":3479625049,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PZt1Z","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T09:29:57Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T10:17:00Z","body":"> --upwards - not sure why this option exist, seems completely useless, maybe we should remove in entirely?\r\n\r\nActually, it is used for a bunch (GLTF, DDS, GDScript) of unit tests (which make sense, tests are upwards of `bin` sub-folder), so I guess it should stay at least in the editor builds. Not as argument, but underlaying code is used.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3479625049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3479826695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909#issuecomment-3479826695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111909","id":3479826695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PafEH","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T10:23:59Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T10:23:59Z","body":"Removed `--upwards` argument, but not `ProjectSetting` code for it, since it used (by directly calling `setup`) by unit tests.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3479826695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godo